PROMPTS FOR PERSONNAL PORTFOLIO

1. PROMPT 1 -  PROJECT SETUP &  DESIGN 
Create a  Personal Portfolio Website for NWAGBARA BLESSING CHIAMAKA, a Full Stack Web Developer and AI Automation Trainee, by generating a complete HTML and Vanilla CSS Codes.

Requirements:
Use semantic HTML structure and vanilla CSS.
Create a dark theme design.
Primary Background of Black
Primary Color of dark red
Text Colors: White and Light Gray
Use font-family of Roboto & Montserrat
Enable smooth scrolling.
Create utility classes for buttons, containers, grids, and section spacing.
Ensure responsive design for desktop, tablet, and mobile
Organize code with comments.


